---
// Act Two — Logline. Phase 2 will drop in final prose.
---

<section class="logline section-y gutter-x">
  <div class="inner" data-reveal>
    <p class="meta">Logline</p>
    <p class="logline__copy display-md">
      Inside the billion-dollar world of international show jumping — where
      Olympic athletes, dynastic heirs, and the <em>horses that bind them</em>
      chase the sport's ultimate prize across a year on the road to the 2028
      Los Angeles Games.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .logline {
    background: var(--color-paper);
    min-height: 70vh;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }
  .inner {
    max-width: 56rem;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }
  .logline__copy {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 3rem);
  }
  .logline__copy em {
    color: var(--color-bay);
  }
</style>
